{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"一个原本很喜欢对方、却害怕自己的需要成为负担的人，在对方持续给予亲近和陪伴的过程中，逐渐敢于承认和表达自己的感情。虽然他始终担心这份关系有一天会结束，最终还是选择珍惜眼前、不再隐藏喜欢，也不再强求对方保证永远。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"caught\": \"心动却怕成负担\",\n      \"echo\": \"\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"caught\": \"亲近甜蜜又怕失去\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"caught\": \"享受当下却难开口\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"caught\": \"想坦白又怕破坏自在\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"caught\": \"露出在乎后失了把握\",\n      \"echo\": \"S04\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"caught\": \"对方如常，安心又孤单\",\n      \"echo\": \"S05\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"caught\": \"觉得自己也能被需要\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"caught\": \"想主动回应却仍不踏实\",\n      \"echo\": \"S07\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"caught\": \"怕失去又被陪伴安慰\",\n      \"echo\": \"S07\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"caught\": \"选择享受眼前亲近\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"caught\": \"不再为喜欢道歉\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"caught\": \"尽情付出，不再收着喜欢\",\n      \"echo\": \"S11\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"caught\": \"想要永远保证又怕失去\",\n      \"echo\": \"S09\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"caught\": \"不索要永远，终于坦白\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"最吃力的是 S06—S09 和 S12—S13，安心、孤单、被需要、害怕失去等情绪反复交叠，容易觉得几段在讲相似的心情，不容易立刻抓住每段的新变化。最抓人的是 S01 和 S14 的首尾呼应：开头有话不敢说，最后终于说完了；中间反复的靠近、退缩和重新鼓起勇气，让这个变化很有感染力。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ea0ac723-d24c-414f-b7e6-ba8b0c9a495a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T194100958220Z", "elapsed_seconds": 64.015, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:42:04.978629+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bfeda6117adb8fcc6417a5985cc033879300d749b979b2907224f6b8868aba7b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T194100958220Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "87eaf93397c58302b8357835d154a8f90ae63ab3a8702c8cb6d5a94e354c1ba4"}}}
